# {{ titleCase module }} subgraph

A federated GraphQL subgraph for the api-rspack app's `{{ module }}` module. It runs from the same codebase as its own
server mode on port {{ port }}:

```sh
pnpm -F api-rspack dev:subgraph-{{ module }}
```

In development its schema is written to `@example/api-graphql-schema/schemas/__generated__/{{ module }}.graphql`,
which the gateway's `main-supergraph.yaml` reads.
